      "Base is a square: $\\text{Base Area} = 7^2 = 49$",
      "$V = \\frac{1}{3} \\times 49 \\times 11$",
      "$V \\approx 179.67$ cm$^3$"
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "棱錐體積：$V = \\frac{1}{3} \\times \\text{底面積} \\times \\text{高}$",
      "底面為正方形：$\\text{底面積} = 7^2 = 49$",
      "$V = \\frac{1}{3} \\times 49 \\times 11$",
      "$V \\approx 179.67$ cm$^3$"
    ],
    "grading_rubric": [
      "M1: Correct substitution",
      "A1: Final answer 179.67 cm^3"
    ],
