      "Perimeter $\\approx 20.59 + 2(10) = 40.59$ cm"
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "扇形周界 = 弧長 + $2r$",
      "弧長 = $2 \\pi (10) \\times \\frac{118}{360} \\approx 20.59$",
      "周界 $\\approx 20.59 + 2(10) = 40.59$ cm"
    ],
