    "question": "Find the area of the segment cut off by a chord of length $10\\sqrt{2}$ cm in a circle of radius 10 cm (subtending $90^\\circ$ at center).",
    "question_zh": "在一個半徑為 10 cm 的圓中，有一長為 $10\\sqrt{2}$ cm 的弦 (對應圓心角為 $90^\\circ$)。求該弦所截得之弓形的面積。",
    "answer": "28.54 cm^2",
    "correct_answer": "28.54 cm^2",
    "solution_steps": [
      "Area of segment = Area of sector - Area of triangle",
      "Area of sector = $\\pi (10^2) \\times \\frac{90^\\circ}{360^\\circ} = 25 \\pi \\approx 78.54$",
      "Area of triangle = $\\frac{1}{2} (10)(10) \\sin(90^\\circ) = 50$",
      "Area of segment $\\approx 78.54 - 50 = 28.54$ cm$^2$"
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "弓形面積 = 扇形面積 - 三角形面積",
      "扇形面積 = $\\pi (10^2) \\times \\frac{90^\\circ}{360^\\circ} = 25 \\pi \\approx 78.54$",
      "三角形面積 = $\\frac{1}{2} (10)(10) \\sin(90^\\circ) = 50$",
      "弓形面積 $\\approx 78.54 - 50 = 28.54$ cm$^2$"
    ],
    "grading_rubric": [
      "M1: Correct substitution",
      "A1: Final answer 28.54 cm^2"
